{"version":1,"content":"<p>方東昇、黃曉瑩及李嘉嘉主持的《醫生，你有病？</p><p>》，昨晚（13日）播出第7集，主角是專攻專注力失調及過度活躍症（ADHD）的美國加州執照兒科醫生王玉珍。</p><p>王醫生是典型ADHD患者，方東昇團隊見證她將「失調」變「協調」，與ADHD共存，活出精彩快樂人生。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:39.682648+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T08:21:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T10:58:13.637978+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416480+00:00","content_hash":"5ae50221e4b9f7ed96e6d4171640770a0199d7c074d863f1fd3e5dc170222007","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}